{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1494682-the-new-demigod-immortal-knacks","id":1494682,"title":"The new Demigod Immortal knacks","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-10-09T10:24:44-07:00","id":1494682,"title":"The new Demigod Immortal knacks","content":"Many of the new Immortal Knacks in the Demigod book work with imbuing legend for feat of scale.<br /> Its not compleatly clear to me if they are only available to Demigods or they are ment to be put in with the normal immortal Knacks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3356-kalle","name":"Kalle","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-09T11:39:30-07:00","id":1494687,"title":"","content":"My interpretation is no, as the effect would make it easy to keep scale for a long time, while it is pretty hard to improve scale for Heroes, even with the available Legend and Scale for heroes being much limited.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-09T12:52:10-07:00","id":1494692,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1494682-the-new-demigod-immortal-knacks?p=1494687#post1494687\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My interpretation is no, as the effect would make it easy to keep scale for a long time, while it is pretty hard to improve scale for Heroes, even with the available Legend and Scale for heroes being much limited.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is at least one Immortal knack for each Calling in Scion: Hero that offers the same type of effect. The Immortal Knacks in Demigod fit right in with the rest of the Knacks people can get when making a new Hero character. The ones in Demigod just offer more examples of how Knacks like that can work.<br /> <br /> <b>Scion Hero</b><br /> Lifted From Dust (Immortal Creator): Imbue for Feat of Scale<br /> Eternal Guardian (Immortal Guardian): Imbue for Feat of Scale<br /> Panacea (Immortal Healer): Imbue for Feat of Scale<br /> Relentless (Immortal Hunter): Imbue for Feat of Scale<br /> I am the Law (Immortal Judge): Imbue for Feat of Scale<br /> Not Today Friends (Immortal Leader): Imbue for Feat of Scale<br /> Pierce the Veil (Immortal Liminal): Imbue for Feat of Scale<br /> Hearts Aflame (Immortal Lover): Imbue for Feat of Scale<br /> Lover's Oath (Immortal Lover): Imbue for Feat of Scale<br /> Eternal Genius (Immortal Sage): Imbue for Feat of Scale<br /> Woven from Lies (Immortal Trickster): Imbue for Feat of Scale<br /> Hurl to the Moon (Immortal Warrior): Imbue for Feat of Scale<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4270-literatzi","name":"literatzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4270_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-09T20:24:19-07:00","id":1494709,"title":"","content":"Pretty sure that is solely representing how they work when it is a demigod using them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-09T21:09:00-07:00","id":1494711,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:arial\">The Immortal Knacks section on page 149 specifies, &quot;A wider variety of Knacks are available that allow you to Imbue for Scale,&quot; which implies the Knacks in that section are meant for Demigods. If PCs were always able to take those Knacks, becoming a Demigod wouldn't result in a wider variety becoming available.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25506,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","user":"Shepherdboi","date":". 10-10-2022, 12:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-09T21:20:15-07:00","id":1494712,"title":"","content":"Eh, does not say you can't. Leaning toward awesome and saying you can in my game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-09T23:20:07-07:00","id":1494714,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I too, read the text on page 149 to say that the new knacks are only available to Demigods.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I thought they might be more powerful than the ones from the Hero book and they would change the power balance.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">But the new ones don't seem that different or game changing then the ones from the Hero book.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">If you compare \u201cHero Creator: </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Lifted From Dust\u201d with \u201cDemigod Creator: Redefine </span><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">the World\u201d one works with civilization (planning a city or designing a civilization) and the other with natural phenomena (moving a mountain, slowing a hurricane).</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Or \u201cHero Sage: Eternal Genius\u201d vs. \u201cDemigod Sage: False!\u201d, the first one works on solving scholarly problems, the other on illusions and falsehoods.</span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3356,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3356-kalle","user":"Kalle","date":". 10-10-2022, 02:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3356-kalle","name":"Kalle","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-10T08:57:27-07:00","id":1494734,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty sure the intention is for anyone to be able to take those knacks, and the line on 149 is to clarify the developer intention that the players now have more options to choose from at any level of play.<br /> <br /> Source: I was the knack writer's sounding board and we tested a number of the new knacks in our Hero game, but the intention could have totally changed from draft to final product. Hopefully a Dev can weigh in. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1093-arlecchino\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1093_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1093\" data-vbnamecard=\"1093\">Arlecchino</a> ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <b>Mod Voice is <u><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span></u>*</b><br /> <i>*All other colors should be read aloud in the voice of Don Knotts</i><b>.</b> <hr /><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/18519-pendragon-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">Hacks and House Rules Hub Thread</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>CofD Hacks By Splat: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13vBLaS5Ua1Ez-cVyK6uFa4ssvYeIIZpoA5GQTXytfcA/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Vampire</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sqltG7X-C_MdEe00PtVOZmki8V_K1M1FpQtLwTvb2jg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#006400\">Werewolf</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bpr1EjQ4RfZ5dz-tXmJJ93P2f_l7fUIUwpPLWs9Z-SI/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">Mage</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vKpSTktCUuUaqxXncG4txQPtvPclzXlFZEEX7tbrTSg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Mummy</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Spynbcs_VgCDHdooKWXobZNe6C9CMjONeRTlvXIq9fI/edit?usp=drive_web\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Demon</span></a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/148-pendragon","name":"PenDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1657"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-10T23:33:38-07:00","id":1494778,"title":"","content":"This clears the issue up a little, but it would be nice with a word from a developer.<br /> <br /> The new Knacks i the Players Guide: Saints and Monsters, doesn't have the &quot;demigod only&quot; restriction on any of the new Immortal Knacks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3356-kalle","name":"Kalle","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-12T08:38:07-07:00","id":1494867,"title":"","content":"It wold be nice with a clarification if possible...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3356-kalle","name":"Kalle","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-12T17:47:39-07:00","id":1494893,"title":"","content":"Not a dev, but a writer for Scion: Yes, you can take any Immortal Knacks at Hero.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Scion 2E</b> Freelancer: <i>Origin; Hero; Demigod; God; Mythical Denizens; Mysteries of the World; Saints &amp; Monsters; No Gods, No Masters; Once &amp; Future, Realms of Magic &amp; Mystery</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/369-geoffrey","name":"Geoffrey","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-12T23:09:20-07:00","id":1494910,"title":"","content":"Thanks a lot","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3356-kalle","name":"Kalle","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}